 "notModeled": [
  "ADR0/ADR1 floating (or VA/2) states: VSSOP addresses 0x50 (both floating), 0x51/0x52 (ADR1 floating), 0x54 (ADR1 GND, ADR0 floating), 0x58 (ADR1 VA, ADR0 floating) cannot be expressed; GND/VA combinations are in the table, SCL/SDA ties are not listed (null)",
  "the SOT-6 package (DDC) has no address pins: fixed 0x54 (1010100) set per package",
  "ALERT output (open drain, polarity CONFIG.POLARITY, enable CONFIG.ALERT_PIN_EN): never asserted",
  "analog input (the result is always the 0 V code 0x000)",
  "alert function: VHIGH/VLOW/VHYST comparison, ALERT_STATUS flag setting and self-clearing, the CONVERSION.ALERT_FLAG bit (never set: no comparison); ALERT_STATUS W1C is modeled",
  "VMIN/VMAX tracking in automatic mode (stored only)",
  "normal mode: the conversion starts at the ACK of a read address byte (1 us typ, no max given); the model starts the next conversion after each read of the result",
  "automatic mode interval uses 1 / the typical fconvert of the Cycle Time table (no max given)",
  "I2C Hs-mode master code entry, quiet interface mode, automatic power-down between conversions",
  "power-on reset brown-out behaviour (VA must fall below 200 mV to reset)"
